  "description": "🦋☀️ 45 Whimsical Summer Butterfly Clipart Bundle 🌸🌼\nAdd color, sunshine, and delicate beauty to your designs with this enchanting Whimsical Summer Butterfly Clipart Bundle! This lovely collection includes 45 hand-painted butterfly illustrations fluttering through bright summer scenes—surrounded by blooming flowers, wildflowers, sunshine, soft greenery, and cheerful seasonal elements.\nEach illustration is designed in a soft whimsical watercolor style with vibrant summer hues and graceful details. Delivered in high-resolution 300 DPI PNG format with transparent backgrounds, these cliparts are perfect for both digital and print projects.\n🎨 What’s Included:\n45 high-quality PNG files\nTransparent backgrounds\n300 DPI resolution for crisp, vibrant prints\nBright and pastel summer color palette\n🌻 Perfect For:\nSummer greeting cards & invitations 💌\nStickers & planner decorations 📒\nT-shirts, tote bags & mugs 👕\nScrapbooking & DIY crafts ✂️\nWedding & baby shower decor 🌸\nSublimation & print-on-demand designs\n✨ Why You’ll Love It:\nBeautiful whimsical butterfly designs 🦋\nHand-painted watercolor aesthetic\nEasy-to-use transparent PNG files\nIdeal for POD & sublimation\nLight, airy, and cheerful summer theme ☀️🌼\nBring a bright, elegant, and whimsical touch to your summer creations with these charming butterfly illustrations! 🦋✨",
